<td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="lf-qn">14</td>
<td>計算：<span class="fd"><span class="n">7</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span> ÷ <span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> = ？（倒數→約簡→相乘）</td>
<td class="sc" style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;font-weight:900;">5分</td>
<td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="lf-qn">15</td>
<td>計算：3<span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> ÷ <span class="fd"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> = ？（帶Fraction→假Fraction→倒數相乘→化簡）</td>
<td class="sc" style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;font-weight:900;">5分</td>
<td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="lf-qn">16</td>
<td><div style="text-align:center;margin:8px 0;padding:6px;background:#FAFBFC;border:1px solid var(--borderc);border-radius:4px;">
<div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:4px;">▲ Circle：半徑7cm（π=22/7）</div>
<div style="display:inline-block;max-width:280px;"><svg height="160" viewbox="0 0 180 160" width="180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="90" cy="70" fill="#DBEAFE" r="60" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></circle><circle cx="90" cy="70" fill="#1A3C6D" r="3"></circle><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="90" y="63">O</text><line stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" x1="90" x2="150" y1="70" y2="70"></line><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="120" y="63">r</text><line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="5,2" stroke-width="2" x1="30" x2="150" y1="78" y2="78"></line><text fill="#DC2626" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="90" y="92">d=2r</text></svg></div>
</div>
一個Circle的半徑 = 7 cm。求 (a) Circle周 (b) CircleArea。（取 π = <span class="f"><span class="n">22</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span>）</td>
<td class="sc" style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;font-weight:900;">5分</td>
<td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td>
</tr>
